own licences.

At the user's request Kontor downloads a build of CPython (Python Software
Foundation License 2; built by python-build-standalone,
https://github.com/astral-sh/python-build-standalone) to run in. It is not
part of Kontor and comes under its own licences, which lie in its folder.

Kontor names everything of this kind it uses on a Mac, with version, licence
and origin, under Settings -> Updates.
